HQ_SPEC_TIMING: per-step GPU-event timing of verify / accept / draft (experiment X-17, decision D12).

Variant image only, never in patches/series. Inert unless HQ_SPEC_TIMING=1 in the engine's
environment. Adds vllm/v1/worker/gpu/spec_timing.py (torch.cuda.Event ring, lazy Event.query()
resolution, cumulative JSON log line "HQ_SPEC_TIMING {...}", optional Prometheus) and six
one-line hooks in v1/worker/gpu/model_runner.py. Cut against: vLLM 0.31.0 + patches/series
(51) + the four KVarN patches, paths relative to the vllm package directory:
  patch -p1 --fuzz 0 -d "$SP" -i spec-timing.patch

